{"term": {"label": "親", "occurrences": 4, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "2B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gongsun-chou-ii", "title": "公孫丑下", "description": "孟子曰：「天時不如地利，地利不如人和。三里之城，七里之郭，環而攻之而不勝。夫環而攻之，必有得天時者矣；然而不勝者，是天時不如地利也。城非不高也，池非不深也，兵革非不堅利也，米粟非不多也；委而去之，是地利不如人和也。故曰：域民不以封疆之界，固國不以山谿之險，威天下不以兵革之利。得道者多助，失道者寡助。寡助之至，親戚畔之；"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "三", "id": "三"}, {"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "今", "id": "今"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "公", "id": "公"}, {"form": "古", "id": "古"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "周", "id": "周"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "欲", "id": "欲"}, {"form": "燕", "id": "燕"}, {"form": "畔", "id": "畔"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "管叔", "id": "管叔"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "過", "id": "過"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.252762968495368, "source": "君子", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.4350845252893227, "source": "君子", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 2.063693184711697, "source": "君子", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.533696813957432, "source": "君子", "target": "古"}, {"weight": 2.9391619220655967, "source": "君子", "target": "過"}, {"weight": 1.6582280766035324, "source": "君子", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 1.3297240096314962, "source": "過", "target": "公"}, {"weight": 1.6863989535702288, "source": "過", "target": "周"}, {"weight": 2.716018370751387, "source": "過", "target": "古"}, {"weight": 1.1474024528375417, "source": "過", "target": "今"}, {"weight": 1.552867560945706, "source": "知", "target": "使"}, {"weight": 0.8597203803857607, "source": "知", "target": "公"}, {"weight": 1.2163953243244932, "source": "知", "target": "周"}, {"weight": 1.3705460041517514, "source": "知", "target": "畔"}, {"weight": 0.5596157879354227, "source": "今", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 0.04879016416943205, "source": "今", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 0.6773988235918061, "source": "今", "target": "燕"}, {"weight": 1.3705460041517514, "source": "燕", "target": "畔"}, {"weight": 0.3364722366212129, "source": "欲", 